  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The selfie expression feature is incredibly powerful for vtubing. However actually using it for vtubing is kind of clunky at the moment. You have to set up the camera to point towards you, locally locked, world off, etc. That then prevents you from using the camera for other things, certain actions like crouching break it, and if you restart the game or crash you need to set it all up again.\n\nIt would be really great if we could get something like a spout sender from the perspective of the face mirror to simplify and make the whole process more robust.",
